# `floe build` owns every TypeScript file under `src/`. The `.fl` file
# beside it is the source, and the output goes to `.floe/src/`. This
# repository committed those emitted files until issue #1557, and the
# committed copies drifted from the compiler for four months.
/src/**/*.ts
/src/**/*.tsx

# Hand-written. These bootstrap React around the Floe code, and no `.fl`
# file produces them. Add a line here when you add another one.
!/src/env.d.ts
!/src/main.tsx
!/src/router.tsx
